  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazilian Agriculture and Livestock Platform of Sustainability: Traceability and Certification</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to develop the Brazilian Agriculture and Livestock Platform of Sustainability: Traceability and Certification for Supply Chains, to promote a low-emission and reduced deforestation development, systematizing information from different sources. On its stage 1, corresponding to the present project under the Readiness instrument of the GCF, the project will tackle cattle and soybean in the Legal Amazon.</narrative>
  </description>
